{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-g10-91",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Illustrate the sphere with center S, a surface point M, radius R, coordinate origin O, and a projected three-dimensional rectangular coordinate frame. No exercise answers or numerical coordinate labels are added.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/evidence/stemrobin188-source222224/author-attempt/files/source222224-author/work/9-10g/pages/0223/figures/fig-g10-91.png",
      "sha256": "987c69e5a02d90818b942bcf0eeecfcab4bfdb9eaf44b62329e02f61c83ddc6a"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c2-s3-n62",
        "text": "2.\n给定一个直角坐标系，来建立以$S(a,b,c)$为中心、$R$为半径的球面方程（图91）。\n球面上的任一点$M$ $(x,y,z)$都满足等式$|SM|=R$。\n\n因此，利用两点间距离公式（§44），得到：\n$(x-a)^2+(y-b)^2+(z-c)^2=R^2$。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c2-s3-n62",
        "text": "如果$a=b=c=0$，就得到球心在坐标原点的球面方程：\n$x^2+y^2+z^2=R^2$。"
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
